  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Education for Children with Disabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this cooperative agreement is to improve the quality of education starting at pre-schools to primary grades among children with disabilities. enable will focus on improving parental involvement, bringing together multiple stakeholders, and strengthening existing service delivery systems. the program&apos;s goal is to ensure that children with disabilities acquire foundational literacy and numeracy skills.</narrative>
  </description>
